# How long did Mozart live?
subtitle: "Guess when Mozart was born and how old he was when he died, then see how short the life behind six hundred works was."

## How long did Mozart live?
    scale born y 520 label Born min 1700 max 1800 value 1756 ticks 4 hidden true
    scale age y 300 label "Age at death" unit years min 0 max 80 value 35 ticks 2 hidden true
    text works "600+ works" x 500 y 690 font_size 34 hidden true

When did Mozart live, and for how long? He wrote his first pieces as a small boy, and over six hundred works in all.
    draw born works

    ask "When do you think he was born? Click on the line." on born store b default "1770"
        right: Close: you said {b}; it was {b.true}, in Salzburg.
        wrong: You said {b}. It was {b.true}, in Salzburg, fourteen years before Beethoven.

Now the length of his life. Six hundred works must take a long one, you would think.
    draw age

    ask "How old was he when he died?" on age store a default "60" tolerance 0.06
        right: Yes: {a.true}.
        wrong: You said {a}. He was only {a.true}.

    erase works

He died in 1791, at thirty-five. All of it, the operas, the symphonies, the Requiem left unfinished, came in that short span.
    shape life #b5482e shape rect x 664.5 y 520 width 245 height 16 style.fill #b5482e style.opacity 0.55
    text died "1791" #b5482e x 787 y 572 font_size 28
